{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20269uxPZISMSR1793283763.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>衞生署HIV測試服務網站，恢復正常運作。<br/></p><p>衞生署上周五發現，HIV測試服務網站電郵戶口懷疑被不正當使用，冒充衞生署向市民發出電郵或短訊，聲稱收件人有感染愛滋病病毒的風險，須盡快求醫和接受檢測。</p><p></p><p>署方指初步調查確認，全部收件人的電郵地址和短訊號碼均為無效，沒有市民收到相關虛假訊息，經網絡安全專家全面檢查後，已修復系統風險隱患，網站恢復正常運作。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:54.561108+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T13:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T22:58:11.993743+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:30.726763+00:00","content_hash":"586fc30f005d348e6cb2d61d9ba29ac33fa0f7f3c3dce3f35f0a36697dc20f1e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:54.561108+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}